#: scenario7:scenario7_4E77BB0A_41C7_4E74_BEFF_6D5F3A6E5C9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2979f82e7de70cc44e463d4d43965f393cc273ec1e65f5f995b28d560a8ea9dc
