msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I didn’t know you were home, Georges."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Georges ! Je ne savais pas que tu étais de retour."

#: scenario7:scenario7_98404427_389F_4D69_887E_D7799D4222A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52f245105bec1a18c97fc724b68188049d5c9a3eed9fa03ee88f8d0aab498f8c
