#: scenario7:scenario7_09DFDE46_6D2D_4CE8_92A9_44E280B4AFD4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e4d42aa1008895aeb33c85319da6936d0edb5b5e249f753c0dcb7d5bd76d7ca
