msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I had two older brothers."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫J’avais deux frères aînés."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F6FD7D33_A16B_4BEE_9AA7_52A0128B576F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 259c81dfaf282565ea28a7d591452dee66e8a355ce67c130a63d6ecc1b7b2c8d
#. default-sha256: 6ef7000410a2d5345c1d31f8a7677d3e1736434fb1ef2900f76049fcf8c469bd
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F6FD7D33_A16B_4BEE_9AA7_52A0128B576F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The eldest, Didier, belonged to an order of knights that served the Church."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le plus âgé, Didier, appartenait à un ordre de chevaliers qui servaient l’⟪k:1⟫É⟪k:2⟫glise."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5CE21799_E4B2_4AA3_AFB1_271B4FB2579C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9bf36f3acc00319f20d88a981b053a096be722421da499a5e72d1c9e7c57fd35
#. default-sha256: 01f4951c98418f2d4ab2f7dd3c5cba6a90e89b2ad35e43e2b237643afd3c66c9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5CE21799_E4B2_4AA3_AFB1_271B4FB2579C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And below him was Georges, who served as a court artist."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le second, Georges, était artiste à la cour."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C2FAD12A_1A86_4F8D_9661_1A24D8113827
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c5746a5fbdca566818f90860cf76761583134d9b19e693fd42b281002434f4b
#. default-sha256: 5f3e1432a2e42f12453f01c611e88113c3ca1c75ac205a5e158df0cc7142d7f1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C2FAD12A_1A86_4F8D_9661_1A24D8113827"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was, in all likelihood, who would inherit the family estate,⟪k:1⟫as knights were not "
"formally allowed to own property."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Comme les chevaliers n’étaient pas formellement autorisés à être propriétaires, c’était lui, "
"selon toute vraisemblance, qui hériterait du domaine familial."

#: scenario7:scenario7_7B2E246B_09D9_4CC7_BC27_FC94313AEFE1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db4bc92d87c49f67c2e48bf7e35e4bedcb3397233121dab0d15f8c330b8b7b5d
#. default-sha256: b350b00e859d1c408c54b98970732b8ee1f204232f7d69279c8709c44f8cc443
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7B2E246B_09D9_4CC7_BC27_FC94313AEFE1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nevertheless, the Bollinger family name was upheld by Didier."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Néanmoins, c’était Didier qui faisait respecter le nom des Bollinger."

#: scenario7:scenario7_AD1B4A28_CEB0_442E_8EF3_BFF5A855B1B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2418791ef77d5e70f4090b990c2e78d1a9a9679a0ecf3f0b70a8900f9279b1f1
