msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AD1B4A28_CEB0_442E_8EF3_BFF5A855B1B6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then there was me, the youngest—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the only daughter."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et puis, il y avait moi, la cadette —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ la seule fille."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6C9D1053_1A98_4762_893E_69AFE856DEBF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df2bd62ebb7b53dfa3e76faa1050b360fe4b8eac0de980a7776f03fe377b3a2f
#. default-sha256: 38adfbc95ce72eb731b5c53199f4fa5dd3036e3dc5b7b7b56b227465fa0e2953
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6C9D1053_1A98_4762_893E_69AFE856DEBF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Physically, I was not in particularly good health.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Because of the color of my skin, "
"I was hypersensitive to sunlight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’avais une santé fragile.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫À⟪k:4⟫ cause de la couleur de ma peau, j’étais "
"extrêmement sensible à la lumière."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4380A140_94F1_4C41_8683_C53498013BFA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 303c2f285cec08a5661555be7a956d32095137a322885f55f521165d6704a6ec
#. default-sha256: 198514c60d9ee65dbde2176c12c7c2f0cf97fb5100941c7f13ccc32cf3b9ff1b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4380A140_94F1_4C41_8683_C53498013BFA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I rarely left the estate. ⟪k:1⟫My world was contained entirely within these walls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je quittais rarement le domaine. ⟪k:1⟫Mon univers se résumait entièrement à ce qu’il y avait "
"entre ces murs."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2044A04C_BCA6_41A9_8A50_912DB7080785
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc8b00e8aa7e09c1a7508d519bc9333f9437cbf00c4d2413b226ad6ae0323d2a
#. default-sha256: 8948869d6d46b6de1df4dc7ac88787690ea883e4f4954ce6da87893e10844806
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2044A04C_BCA6_41A9_8A50_912DB7080785"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And perhaps out of some sense of pity or compassion,⟪k:1⟫my two brothers spent a good deal "
"of time with me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et, peut-être par pitié, peut-être par compassion,⟪k:1⟫mes deux frères passaient beaucoup de "
"temps en ma compagnie."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A2D05211_ACC3_49DB_89DB_EEDF7A9D8979
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 068edf0310dcb882362276fa518db1e249f1de48a4f1b9fcdd63c2fa3f60e9ea
#. default-sha256: e58dc8dba815093d4963b7250e6e6ff1e3482b6f839d7276608880ad9bd711c5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A2D05211_ACC3_49DB_89DB_EEDF7A9D8979"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Didier played chess with me, and Georges taught me how to draw."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Didier jouait aux échecs avec moi et Georges m’apprenait à dessiner."

#: scenario7:scenario7_638139D8_135C_4AAA_86B3_F046485B7999
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 835b16eeb7f6ecd5a43cea93288a469cf5f0a446025bf9e3a7bd370e80716e00
#. default-sha256: c1e28a6808464e4a00c88eb793c200a8986b884ee1462c05108d4678c7ad44ba
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_638139D8_135C_4AAA_86B3_F046485B7999"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And among other things, they taught me how to read and write.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫For a girl, I was "
"incredibly fortunate."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Entre autres choses, ils m’apprirent à lire et à écrire.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Pour une fille, j’avais "
"énormément de chance."

#: scenario7:scenario7_211612B5_6D74_41B6_B14A_6FEC23EE533C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8858a2ec3f825f1dacf675aa564672ac1ba9240efe99378ea6fa437bfd096a89
#. default-sha256: 4cf827d09a43c86473bc79efbd657de5038f8cdb986bc171455c7dd0de62bb81
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_211612B5_6D74_41B6_B14A_6FEC23EE533C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The one thing I wasn’t allowed to do, though, was hold a sword."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La seule chose que je n’avais pas le droit de faire, cependant, c’était de tenir une épée."

#: scenario7:scenario7_22C434B2_4CF3_4B38_B305_E352B14E7470
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: afdba751d5d15acdd299cc3fa9fee904e0513a6a05b303f0e6fbc5e67df56f95
#. default-sha256: 158d7edb74ee3f7ee95b3145917d5a5c54615c6db722baadbdedc3fc22fd71f3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_22C434B2_4CF3_4B38_B305_E352B14E7470"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫While hardly anything unusual, it bothered me deeply."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ça n’avait rien d’inhabituel mais ça me gênait profondément."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9DA2CE17_6D52_4AD7_8BE6_7554BB814987
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1139d257a63160c27542a6b28eb7a11e736dc6a50af5264df8cd732a34d0000
#. default-sha256: c835fa9fa80515c0f73b9e41f96962dd2f2cd297aa79cbd0430664b476f8ac7e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9DA2CE17_6D52_4AD7_8BE6_7554BB814987"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And it had for as long as I could remember."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ça m’avait toujours gêné, aussi loin que je m’en souvienne."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DFBBA795_374C_4B95_A3D4_D000C829AE2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f31a6d930bfbd606d1b927adf13449b0996713b58148eb918d1ff46e81b97290
#. default-sha256: dc6a5210d26268ace22e8dd665e39865f857492a3c8cfe17dcbe72b62355e165
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DFBBA795_374C_4B95_A3D4_D000C829AE2C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I had been told I couldn’t do it because I lacked the strength,⟪k:1⟫I probably would have "
"accepted it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si on m’avait dit que je ne pouvais pas à cause de mon manque de force, je l’aurais "
"probablement accepté."

#: scenario7:scenario7_7C983434_7E1C_4DA1_979E_74604548F401
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11cefcea5242a01f2a964218491a11a35e3e5604c2f961ebad17e1359a654bfc
#. default-sha256: 5b2bdb9ad6ac3e5d3f54db0c3905689f0fef282be19e6dc778fb8117e5e41a0e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7C983434_7E1C_4DA1_979E_74604548F401"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But the reason given was not that I was weak—⟪k:1⟫but that I was a girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais la raison donnée n’était pas la faiblesse,⟪k:1⟫ mais le fait que j’étais une fille."

#: scenario7:scenario7_600D3ABE_49B0_4D6B_9593_986056A7D486
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1506e5d94c839a69c7dd0185fcc693e7da0f3a4f8072f5e816a9fa02c6eb482a
#. default-sha256: e77239d651c99ecfbe6ae85eb4cdb8ca0ebe2141c42320f309964a35b61adeec
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_600D3ABE_49B0_4D6B_9593_986056A7D486"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And with each passing year, that smoldering frustration in the back of my heart grew larger."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et à chaque année qui passait, cette frustration qui couvait au fond de mon cœur gagnait en "
"intensité."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C747822F_1142_48E1_AEFF_7713B30EF201
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 120722d074fdb7a0842602a1f212ed0321d94ce2efb6a400ace76b7009a08f54
