msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Come on! Put your back into it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Allez ! Du nerf !"

#: scenario7:scenario7_36EE3520_274C_40E3_AACF_BBDDB32D87FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cca0b4f3149e6190d74fe63934fd28931b566a0acd65036e19fe3d2b434f3d3d
#. default-sha256: 6a99cc1f59c0525802c8128aa0ed12a2ed058ae4a25a46a501dcaa72eb962667
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_36EE3520_274C_40E3_AACF_BBDDB32D87FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫L— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫L-⟪k:3⟫Like I said, all I want is to put on a good show!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫C-⟪k:3⟫Comme je t’ai dit, tout ce que je veux, c’est donner un beau spectacle !"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B43EE665_7015_405D_8D78_69614B80EB12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67e8ab24b03fee40845a4ca00f200f20b35d96cbb863fb5677799299c1e1879c
#. default-sha256: c92f79a604f5fb108b9c17b55bc169ea92445894cce59bc49d63e472538e27ef
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B43EE665_7015_405D_8D78_69614B80EB12"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh, you’ll put on ⟪k:1⟫quite⟪k:2⟫ a show!⟪k:3⟫Unless you learn how to swing that sword "
"properly!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh, tu risques de te donner en spectacle tout court !⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫À⟪k:3⟫ moins que tu "
"n’apprennes à manier cette épée correctement !"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2EB98549_78DA_4A36_9732_BCA8DA8713D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
