msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"

#: scenario7:scenario7_15D2AB99_1918_4402_BEEB_E53A12C46FDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b15460809e565c36f2006c13188e0b049a29b1cf7c6b6f27292e43c9589923cb
