msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_40CC3113_166E_4F46_AB19_9B65026E3104"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫“You are my little girl, after all.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫« Tu es ma petite fille, après tout »."

#: scenario7:scenario7_97EE9F1F_BDCD_4642_A558_613823B6A2B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5efa04a98536351c1a7cfe1df97ec7320eae40cb15b4b5d1106a6f99aeb9b438
#. default-sha256: ad2cc9090ba318fc0c7058a33170dc6f010c6111a4e7cfec11bafbb34adee5cd
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_97EE9F1F_BDCD_4642_A558_613823B6A2B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And there was nothing strange about that at all.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Every time I looked in the mirror, "
"I saw the daughter of a noble."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et il n’y avait rien d’étrange à cela.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫À⟪k:4⟫ chaque fois que je me regardais "
"dans le miroir, je voyais la fille d’une famille noble."

#: scenario7:scenario7_17CA319E_29B8_4BAC_9174_34D54AC6B73E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c90f1514557942b3377c2fe636d21a18d3e8768cd32adcea62b5926188d1f759
#. default-sha256: f895fb0b8f38c404e77ed786b98f74772aedfc272f8345d01e2f79910fb9ffd2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_17CA319E_29B8_4BAC_9174_34D54AC6B73E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That was who I was."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫C’était bien moi."

#: scenario7:scenario7_31BB60FB_F04C_4B7A_B20C_B8B6D53E67B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed2eeb6fb9e94065196fd76a363763b735e39e249b57ddf0c8edce7a018f2f65
#. default-sha256: afc7e2bc096b7b38b3c289cd575deda54894751104788aa8d3aba61c3c67a0a8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_31BB60FB_F04C_4B7A_B20C_B8B6D53E67B4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So the only thing wrong was how I felt.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But every time I was faced with the reality "
"of who I was,⟪k:3⟫my heart wavered."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’est pourquoi la seule chose qui clochait, c’était ce que je ressentais.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dès que "
"j’étais confrontée à ce que j’étais réellement,⟪k:3⟫mon cœur chancelait."

#: scenario7:scenario7_7D390B35_CFEA_44BA_B2D3_9C4936A62744
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e02b706ac28e589050efcd890d10a3e32203384afc6b544d17575a12523c5546
#. default-sha256: 8c277f217645878f178ac21a662352c7430a1b0e674d64992f48fcf7c263f208
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7D390B35_CFEA_44BA_B2D3_9C4936A62744"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had no interest in learning to embroider.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I didn’t understand why that was "
"necessary."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La broderie ne m’intéressait nullement.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je ne comprenais pas pourquoi il fallait "
"que je m’y applique."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4823A1AD_DAD4_4DB1_ACDD_B3E5A7978C42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e6b405fbb1f36fdf38ff9b25e943e1aae5b468ed6a60de973ddd1de0fae7a18
#. default-sha256: da8b5e082cf8c1dee63634b299da7b564a93cad769657eb159a0c541a7769164
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4823A1AD_DAD4_4DB1_ACDD_B3E5A7978C42"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I knew what ⟪k:1⟫purpose⟪k:2⟫ it served.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Everything she taught me I would need when "
"I was wed off to some noble boy, and it was my responsibility to learn those things."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je savais ⟪k:1⟫dans quel but⟪k:2⟫ elle me l’enseignait.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Comme tout le reste, elle "
"m’apprenait tout ce dont j’aurais besoin une fois qu’on m’aurait mariée à un noble, et il en "
"allait de mon devoir de maîtriser ces compétences."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DD428462_CCB8_4425_9B29_625B4551C86B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22c7deb153591ff3ea43427a709a74d9f1f00396e47a6c3457118482363c8f80
#. default-sha256: c72ce67a16c1bcd0e8a8aa26e97cb95131dbb08e32dad98e471bfcf3bb0fb1a0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DD428462_CCB8_4425_9B29_625B4551C86B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It didn’t ⟪k:1⟫feel⟪k:2⟫ right, though."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais je ⟪k:1⟫sentais⟪k:2⟫ que quelque chose clochait."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DC99167B_038C_4D39_A0E4_1DCA328ED343
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 794e04c4411067886b1b3a539be7ed981be27d43c84166f4fdf6961b4b3d2342
#. default-sha256: a19a7468e945b5fc028848da8ee2926a9d7a321de3b919e782d2bbdaad4e14f8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DC99167B_038C_4D39_A0E4_1DCA328ED343"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t even accept the fact that, one day, I ⟪k:1⟫would⟪k:2⟫ be married.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It was "
"but an ominous shadow lurking in my future."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je n’arrivais même pas à accepter le fait qu’un jour, je ⟪k:1⟫serais⟪k:2⟫ mariée.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Ce n’était qu’une ombre menaçante qui se tapissait dans mon futur."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4C590195_04A2_4FD1_A13E_98ACBEFC6E5B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd64c175acd07052b1f1e8a42e4177e8f8ddeacf6a422bc489044c5aee6163d6
#. default-sha256: 75b2425b5b29510945fa1a2897bb3051fc62e4f8473c2753da275f968ead3b89
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4C590195_04A2_4FD1_A13E_98ACBEFC6E5B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would have preferred ravaging the books in Didier’s room than having a conversation with "
"my mother."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’aurais préféré détruire tous les livres de la chambre de Didier plutôt que d’avoir une "
"conversation avec ma mère."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B2AFDD9C_5C06_4F2B_ABD1_9D6682D27DF9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 353cb820b30528846d54d6c70bf24c99cdfc1c66de86184f0940a0635465d2c9
