msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B2AFDD9C_5C06_4F2B_ABD1_9D6682D27DF9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tales of heroes of old and dauntless soldiers. ⟪k:1⟫Military texts written by tacticians in "
"the midst of war."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les légendes des héros d’antan, des soldats intrépides. ⟪k:1⟫Des manuels militaires rédigés "
"par des généraux en pleine guerre."

#: scenario7:scenario7_02D63A4D_36B0_451F_BA0D_A97A383C2A42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18666ae09122ca63701beb00de81d27702e8dc79ad4f318367f676208bcdf4ba
#. default-sha256: cb4769f66402712443c3ddfeb16e68167cf86bf4f2478bb9bd750f2df5eb483b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_02D63A4D_36B0_451F_BA0D_A97A383C2A42"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Thinking about them set my heart aflutter—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and made me think about my brother. ⟪k:3⟫"
"He was training to be a knight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫À⟪k:2⟫ leur simple évocation, mon cœur bondissait—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ et me faisait penser à mon "
"frère. ⟪k:5⟫Il s’entraînait pour être chevalier."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FB9D7E3E_A529_401F_AD7D_FB5D1B459759
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce99b2ed6f6d36e722106d1b096ee9919848deb791054e30b0c5dc49724daf67
