msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FB9D7E3E_A529_401F_AD7D_FB5D1B459759"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I envisioned armor flecked with rust.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A longsword glimmering with the blood of "
"savages."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je voyais déjà l’armure tachée de rouille.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Une longue épée scintillant du sang des "
"barbares."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9CEA3EE3_8726_48B8_852E_D58FAF6208A4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f794ba38965718e7d4c04dcd81fd551005036ec1c6d18d0932cd6a05d93de53
#. default-sha256: 8914168d8aa2801f5ec8e860498acc3edc04919906e301c796f610708896b2b2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9CEA3EE3_8726_48B8_852E_D58FAF6208A4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Soon, I found myself in my fantasies,⟪k:1⟫imagining how the sword would feel in my hands."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’était dans mes pensées que je me retrouvais enfin,⟪k:1⟫en imaginant la sensation de l’épée "
"entre mes mains."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4D6C3525_8C8E_4717_9B51_FB0174D081E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61dba7d939aff0668630d2c30f30c7985f92bd811bb88582ed24b5b5722fc212
