msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1ECAFF1A_C8D6_47F4_8762_4CB80EC38154"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫How heavy was it?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How much muscle would I need to carry it?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫How much "
"impact would I feel in my hands when I struck something?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Est-ce qu’elle serait lourde ?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Est-ce que j’aurais assez de force pour la soulever ?"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Quelle force aurait l’onde de choc sur mes mains, quand je frapperais quelque chose ?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BB693CB4_54E7_4048_868C_F6CFB4159481
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dce31ec94222bdfc7db4245ba1f4caf08f2c03bbb5b096b4ea16a6e26a79beac
