msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You were at it for a long time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫C’est que vous y êtes depuis un bon moment."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A0DBDD17_4A04_49B0_BAE8_A7578E73066D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 686ce6b97bf1320f7e266698d5528d436971c83cc013946cdfc1a38aff506b96
